cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use FORGE in academic or industry research, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "FORGE — Synthetic Policy Book + Multi-Peril Scenario Set"
version: "0.1.0"
abstract: >
  FORGE is a scenario-coupled catastrophe-operations console for primary
  insurers and reinsurers. One Monte-Carlo scenario set drives three
  optimization layers in parallel: a Portfolio MIP (CBC + PuLP), an
  Operational LP (VRP for adjuster routing), and a claims pre-flagger.
  A shared Decision Reconciler joins their outputs and flags cross-layer
  conflicts. The deposit contains the synthetic 10,000-policy book, the
  multi-peril scenario set (hurricane, severe-convective-storm, wildfire,
  earthquake, winter storm), and the codebase that generates and consumes
  both.
authors:
